[{"id":"1","type":"h1","meta":true,"children":[{"text":"章首导语"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"按方案 A 落实。导语承担全部全局导航（三问题、实验场、案例体系、编号约定、三档阅读路径），9.1.6 收窄为承接 9.1.1–9.1.5 论证的路线收束；导语内两张表"},{"text":"不编号","bold":true},{"text":"（维持审校方案的表号重排不变，兑现方案 A 的零编号影响）。另有一处主动优化：导语案例表不列 Finding 编号（MONEY-001 等），因为编号格式在 9.3 才正式定义，提前出现会破坏教学顺序——只列 PR 编号、案例、出场位置，并指向 9.3/9.7。"}],"id":"5NivO0iRrd"},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"WA_lvvZgnp"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"1. 章首导语（不编号，置于\"9.1\"标题之前）"}],"id":"vE3Tn-BYKc"},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"排版说明：以下为导语全文，正文中不加节号；两张表为无编号示意表，正式书稿可作引言表格处理。"}],"id":"5gEtTcocIm"}],"id":"lymwJquFFV"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"本章把\"AI 代码评审\"从一个模型输出质量的问题，重构成一个工程系统的问题：怎样把模型放进一条可验证、可回放、可审计、可问责的证据流水线，让每一次评审结论都能追溯到缺陷证据、不变量与人工裁决。围绕这个目标，本章回答三个问题："}],"id":"e2KOAmmdqN"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"评审为什么需要证据而不是意见？","bold":true},{"text":" 模型说\"这段代码有并发问题\"，和它能拿出\"在哪条执行轨迹上、违反哪条不变量、用什么测试复现\"，是两回事。前者是意见，后者才是可以被复核、被回放、被问责的证据。"}],"id":"1wPhpykSpz"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"多个 AI Agent 如何分工、如何仲裁？","bold":true},{"text":" 单一模型在单个任务上能力不足，专业化分工能提升覆盖率，但分工必然带来意见冲突。本章给出最小角色集、仲裁协议与人工治理的边界。"}],"id":"HAiKB7lj2W"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"怎么证明这套系统可信？","bold":true},{"text":" 通过统一 Finding Schema、证据包、录制回放与双层 Oracle 评测，把\"模型说得对不对\"变成可测量的指标，而不是印象。"}],"id":"5-NjYOtPPt"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"全章围绕一个可复现的实验场展开："},{"text":"wallet-review-lab","bold":true},{"text":"，一个刻意保留缺陷的数字钱包仓库。它的四条业务不变量——金额守恒、余额非负、幂等键单次生效、对象所有权——构成评审、仲裁与评测的共同语言，本章每个案例都围绕其中一条或多条展开。"}],"id":"yIXWwk4zCc"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"案例体系与编号约定。","bold":true},{"text":" 本章用一套编号体系贯穿案例、Finding 与 Oracle，全书一致："}],"id":"TbTaSa2S-A"},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"编号","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"SQJupzz-KV"}],"id":"INN-kcrEd1"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"案例","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"Fsc1rCptuH"}],"id":"gLPD13QMyB"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"主要出场位置","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"3XfSpz6uKx"}],"id":"hk2iLM37Rk"}],"id":"gGDNFsG4h3"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-01"}],"type":"p","id":"kNZ_UmdzcC"}],"id":"-eezf8D1HC"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"零缺陷基线（无对应 Finding）"}],"type":"p","id":"YDspuz-hiN"}],"id":"itpCbP7g79"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.3"}],"type":"p","id":"BrMMiQeNk4"}],"id":"huWkUdp0VA"}],"id":"MzKgvrYuAW"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-02"}],"type":"p","id":"GhnhFvRxHn"}],"id":"uGN5KZGks0"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"转账金额守恒破坏"}],"type":"p","id":"bOgXuetpeD"}],"id":"9bE774DxXZ"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.3 → 9.7"}],"type":"p","id":"qLUDBZ-2tq"}],"id":"ElNt-1gmio"}],"id":"4qgwxSuniB"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-03"}],"type":"p","id":"-7VzpwIL0P"}],"id":"c30q2TsoKi"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"授权缺失（对象所有权）"}],"type":"p","id":"iJuIcuIDK_"}],"id":"JzjiCk97Yj"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.7"}],"type":"p","id":"8M7uFHcqUB"}],"id":"PsEWdTHXyv"}],"id":"BAUyWPpGJ8"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-04"}],"type":"p","id":"P9Ga-n7c5c"}],"id":"Z7nF4j_sqo"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"并发双花（余额非负）"}],"type":"p","id":"BX2bZE42yf"}],"id":"IsFyPtmw6J"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.7（主线）→ 9.12"}],"type":"p","id":"V48Nr5fdtO"}],"id":"ykZpjwPj0B"}],"id":"QLVD-TxaT6"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-05"}],"type":"p","id":"_BTus_HrKU"}],"id":"7xmMgRuHIo"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"幂等键失效"}],"type":"p","id":"ZOpEA2pLVd"}],"id":"uCgz8FF0V9"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.7"}],"type":"p","id":"r4Sgn6DxrB"}],"id":"l_WgQoK-A7"}],"id":"PbZHGW05eD"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-07"}],"type":"p","id":"Nms_u4V1qt"}],"id":"dJiP2UDEAo"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"依赖注入（第三方库）"}],"type":"p","id":"N0wv0SxDmB"}],"id":"-f4R8B7vb4"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.7"}],"type":"p","id":"fpqVONSDoe"}],"id":"dNP2Bo8WpU"}],"id":"wpV12JLqP0"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"PR-08"}],"type":"p","id":"7tke5TQx4n"}],"id":"H5DaGorobh"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"提示注入（Agent 安全）"}],"type":"p","id":"cs08N9Kklx"}],"id":"OX-tadddJA"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.7 → 9.11"}],"type":"p","id":"h_mgm7svk5"}],"id":"cMXjMI3I3K"}],"id":"AYs9uZYcwh"}],"id":"EU5-uo5mCw","colSizes":[284.6666666666667,284.6666666666667,284.6666666666667]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"编号沿用项目原稿："},{"text":"PR-06 在原稿中未定义，属于编号跳空，本书保留跳空、不重编号","bold":true},{"text":"。每个案例在正文中出现三次，职能递进：9.3 首次简介建立上下文，9.7 深度拆解（错误补丁→失败机制→可复现测试→Finding→多 Agent 协作→仲裁→修复→回归），9.12 端到端演练（把案例放进完整流水线跑一遍）。PR-04 是贯穿全书的主线案例，只关心核心机制的读者可以从 9.7 的 PR-04 小节直接进入。"}],"id":"doqeLAYQwb"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"缺陷类别与不变量的完整映射见 9.3.2 与 9.8；四角色命名与任务契约以 9.5 为准；Finding 字段定义以 9.6 为准——本章不在此重复这些定义。"}],"id":"Q5fvDJITjE"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"三档阅读路径。","bold":true},{"text":" 全章共 12 节，按读者角色给出路径："}],"id":"SxbzJrA72_"},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"读者","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"CcMzW9zYOZ"}],"id":"9Xet5YfUWf"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"必读","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"LWs3spWGbQ"}],"id":"hLs2GZMffX"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"可跳读","bold":true}],"type":"p","id":"eOLDKcBHK4"}],"id":"-rxT05MAKX"}],"id":"5OWjGnnSml"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"技术负责人／评审流程设计者"}],"type":"p","id":"NQaqb7NFau"}],"id":"rL14tRHjw2"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.1、9.2、9.3、9.5、9.6、9.8、9.10、9.12"}],"type":"p","id":"_fBd0c_oPF"}],"id":"fGjCh-ZRoc"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.4、9.9、9.11"}],"type":"p","id":"cey7uS2SPz"}],"id":"zA6txI2iAc"}],"id":"rbG3oqdg7J"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"开发者／实现者"}],"type":"p","id":"cdTB9m_SDf"}],"id":"fFWswO8cab"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.3、9.4、9.5、9.6、9.7、9.12"}],"type":"p","id":"wuPvcmKkBs"}],"id":"JDUIO36Re3"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.9 基准细节、9.11"}],"type":"p","id":"YUpF3ZlsIG"}],"id":"pUHrb2WGhM"}],"id":"5UMw6U9rNw"},{"type":"tr","children":[{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"安全与治理读者"}],"type":"p","id":"7VqUcyvNQa"}],"id":"3V9vLYJo6m"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.1、9.5.4、9.6.3、9.8、9.11、9.12"}],"type":"p","id":"geLwuy-b6r"}],"id":"U-P4ggw8cy"},{"type":"td","children":[{"children":[{"text":"9.4、9.7 实现细节"}],"type":"p","id":"LQjnEdqrHr"}],"id":"XR48BGf0uk"}],"id":"Mj_pH7GV1a"}],"id":"QIFHeKtRbM","colSizes":[284.6666666666667,284.6666666666667,284.6666666666667]},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"rreqoYW3lv"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"2. 9.1.6 修订（替换原\"本章阅读地图\"内容，标题保留）"}],"id":"bwrOKs0kSP"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"承接 9.1.5\"三个流行答案为什么不够\"的论证，本章的路线可以概括为一条从困境到系统的链路："}],"id":"OtpP5IeqZM"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.2","bold":true},{"text":" 先看工业界三个系统（RADAR、CodeRabbit、CodeAgent）如何应对同样的困境，取其架构经验而非营销数字；"}],"id":"JrEb7-uFsj"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.3","bold":true},{"text":" 建立实验场 wallet-review-lab：数字钱包、四项不变量、Oracle 与可回放基线，让后续每一节都有可执行的载体；"}],"id":"aJw0mxFiRR"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.4–9.6","bold":true},{"text":" 从单 Agent 评审契约，到专业化多 Agent 分工，再到证据流水线（统一 Schema、证据包、风险路由、录制回放）——这是本章的机制内核；"}],"id":"AKGGfI611d"},{"indent":1,"listStyleType":"disc","type":"p","children":[{"text":"9.7","bold":true},{"text":" 用六个案例深度实战，把机制放到真实缺陷上检验；"},{"text":"9.8–9.10","bold":true},{"text":" 解决治理、评测与成本问题；"},{"text":"9.11","bold":true},{"text":" 补上安全防御维度；"},{"text":"9.12","bold":true},{"text":" 以一次端到端演练收束全章。"}],"id":"mZGb7zSMK1"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"全局导航——案例体系表、PR-06 编号约定、三档阅读路径——已在章首导语给出，本节不再重复；四角色命名以 9.5 为准，Finding 字段定义以 9.6 为准。读完全章后，建议回到导语对照案例表检查一遍：每个案例你都能说出它违反哪条不变量、最终由谁仲裁、如何被回放验证。"}],"id":"AyiJ93X2rx"},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"oAwbHAM_L9"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"3. 目录更新"}],"id":"-eiaOj9wF-"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"（章首）第 9 章 把模型放进一条可验证、可回放、可问责的证据流水线"}],"type":"code_line","id":"VwDKrMfOhO"},{"children":[{"text":"　└─ 章首导语（不编号）："}],"type":"code_line","id":"_BM63wW25o"},{"children":[{"text":"　　　本章三问／实验场与四项不变量／案例体系与编号约定（含 PR-06 跳空声明）／三档阅读路径"}],"type":"code_line","id":"pr-sJJmJJW"},{"children":[{"text":"9.1 评审的困境与证据闭环"}],"type":"code_line","id":"hN7nEo-mGL"},{"children":[{"text":"　9.1.1 当瓶颈从\"写代码\"转向\"证明代码\""}],"type":"code_line","id":"soz4FtczZQ"},{"children":[{"text":"　9.1.2 测试通过 ≠ 代码正确"}],"type":"code_line","id":"51PonRLH2t"},{"children":[{"text":"　9.1.3 AI 适合与不适合评审什么"}],"type":"code_line","id":"wNVya0L3dQ"},{"children":[{"text":"　9.1.4 四种不确定性"}],"type":"code_line","id":"O-i8WDlVwD"},{"children":[{"text":"　9.1.5 三个流行答案为什么不够"}],"type":"code_line","id":"iG1HFDUk5Y"},{"children":[{"text":"　9.1.6 本章阅读地图（内容已收窄：从困境到路线的收束，指向导语）"}],"type":"code_line","id":"lpZW0oqebo"},{"children":[{"text":"9.2 …（其余不变）"}],"type":"code_line","id":"Rw98ah3oFo"}],"type":"code_block","id":"ACND5Iay9H"},{"type":"hr","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"N3s6_qP003"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"一致性说明","bold":true},{"text":"：导语与 9.3.2（不变量）、9.7.1（六案例地图）、9.8（映射表）只做指向、不展开定义，无第二套口径；表号重排仍按审校方案执行（导语表无编号，不占表号）；PR-06 声明同时满足审校\"必须修改清单\"第 8 项。需要我把导语并入 9.1 一起重出完整一节，还是继续落实其他子章节的修订？"}],"id":"0dwVpG2S4C"}]